     "body": "<p>I’ve updated <a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Migrate+to+Fedora+6\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Migrate+to+Fedora+6</a>  to add an FAQ about this problem, and also added a note under the upgrade util command to clarify what the base-uri option is:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/pages/diffpagesbyversion.action?pageId=195168144&amp;selectedPageVersions=62&amp;selectedPageVersions=61\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/pages/diffpagesbyversion.action?pageId=195168144&amp;selectedPageVersions=62&amp;selectedPageVersions=61</a></p>",
